WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.925
This query consumes the employee performance
interface The total-sales

00:00:05.952 --> 00:00:11.621
threshold remains outside the view That is useful
because different reports

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:17.411
may choose different thresholds The stable
performance definition stays shared

00:00:17.661 --> 00:00:20.648
while temporary business rules remain
report-specific
